<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> 测试：</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">\`pnpm test\`</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">（优先跑单文件）</span></span>
